{"title": "Levitating (Condition)", "pageid": 35287, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Levitating_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Levitating_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Levitating_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Levitating_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Levitating_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Levitating_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Levitating_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Levitating Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Levitating_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Levitating_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Levitating_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Levitating</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity is suspended in the air. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LEVITATE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLEVITATE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLEVITATE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Levitating\">Sources of Levitating</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Blood_of_Lathander\" title=\"The Blood of Lathander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Blood_of_Lathander\" title=\"The Blood of Lathander\">The Blood of Lathander</a> has this condition when first discovered in <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery\">Rosymorn Monastery's</a> secret chambers.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The status itself is purely informational, usually meant to convey immunity to various surfaces.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Levitating\">Creatures with Levitating</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scrying_Eye\" title=\"Scrying Eye\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Scrying_Eye.png/30px-Portrait_Scrying_Eye.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Scrying_Eye.png/45px-Portrait_Scrying_Eye.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Scrying_Eye.png/60px-Portrait_Scrying_Eye.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scrying Eye\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Scrying_Eye.png/30px-Portrait_Scrying_Eye.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Portrait_Scrying_Eye.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scrying_Eye\" title=\"Scrying Eye\">Scrying Eye</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Levitates in the air continuously.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714222117\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1488/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17962/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6913/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1046679/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.125      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   48.125      1 